    "title": "Retired Union City Service Member to Speak at UT Martin Ceremony - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Charles Choate ,\n10 hours ago\nA retired military member from Union City will be the guest speaker at the UT Martin Veterans Day program next Wednesday. Tasha Bowman, a retired sergeant first class who served more than 20 years in the Tennessee Army National Guard, will speak at the Boling University Center’s Watkins Auditorium.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
